  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Powerlifting Peaking Block: Meet in 21 Days\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Peak squat, bench, and deadlift for meet day\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Peaking Block\" (3 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Squat Volume Reduction\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 4x3 rpe 7 rest 180 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 3x6..8 rpe 7 rest 120 seconds\n          plank 3x40 seconds rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 2m\n          quad_stretch 2m\n      DAY Wednesday training 60m \"Bench Volume Reduction\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 4x3 rpe 7 rest 150 seconds\n          barbell_row 3x6..8 rpe 7 rest 120 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 2m\n          shoulder_stretch 2m\n      DAY Friday training 60m \"Deadlift Volume Reduction\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x2 rpe 7 rest 210 seconds\n          front_squat 2x4..5 rpe 7 rest 150 seconds\n          back_extension 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 2m\n          hamstring_stretch 2m\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Monday training 50m \"Squat Opener Practice\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x2 rpe 7 rest 180 seconds\n          leg_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 2m\n          hip_flexor_stretch 2m\n      DAY Wednesday training 50m \"Bench Opener Practice\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x2 rpe 7 rest 150 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 2m\n          tricep_stretch 2m\n      DAY Friday training 50m \"Deadlift Opener Practice\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x1 rpe 7 rest 210 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 2x5..6 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 2m\n          lat_stretch 2m\n    WEEK 3:\n      DAY Monday training 40m \"Squat Singles and Openers\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 6m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 2x1 rpe 6 rest 180 seconds\n          squat 1x1 rpe 8 rest 240 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 2m\n      DAY Wednesday training 40m \"Bench Singles and Openers\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 6m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 2x1 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          bench_press 1x1 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 2m\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Deadlift Singles and Openers\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 6m\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 2x1 rpe 6 rest 180 seconds\n          deadlift 1x1 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 2m",
